Struggling to breathe just thinking about it, still haunted by the ghost of you, everywhere I look it's like you're always there despite the fact that you left me alone

483
00:49:26,168 --> 00:49:33,668
I'm in my feelings, like rainfall on the ground, they're soaking through the sheets and drenching every single inch of me

484
00:49:34,668 --> 00:49:43,668
I'm in my feelings, it's falling all around, inside this never ending downpour, is there no escape to hope for?

485
00:49:56,168 --> 00:50:01,168
Where you're goin'... I don't wanna know...

