00:50:02,193 --> 00:50:04,993
Don't want you to call me

487
00:50:04,993 --> 00:50:07,993
Don't need you to love me

488
00:50:07,993 --> 00:50:11,993
Don't want your weak explanations, knew that I never met your expectations

489
00:50:12,593 --> 00:50:18,993
Now I just want you out my head, wanna move along, carry on, hold my head high, but

